    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "Starlight firefly Gu is a rank three Gu, small like an ordinary firefly, and when activated it emits genuine azure starlight. Inside Hu Immortal Blessed Land, that starlight is the only source that can form a stargate; keeping a gate open kills one firefly every three breaths. Fang Yuan trades Immortal Gu remnant recipes through Connecting Heaven Gu for large numbers of ordinary starlight fireflies so he can breed his own starlight firefly Gu later, because the Gu themselves cannot reproduce.",
        "chapters": [
          466
